{"id":"forecast-02","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-02/audio-2.mp3","model":"small","duration":453.76,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.74,"text":"Section 2. You'll hear the director of a club giving a talk about an ancient game played on ice called Curling.","words":[["Section",0.0,0.42],["2.",0.42,0.92],["You'll",1.62,2.34],["hear",2.34,2.52],["the",2.52,2.72],["director",2.72,3.08],["of",3.08,3.34],["a",3.34,3.44],["club",3.44,3.74],["giving",3.74,4.38],["a",4.38,4.62],["talk",4.62,4.84],["about",4.84,5.14],["an",5.14,5.34],["ancient",5.34,5.74],["game",5.74,6.28],["played",6.28,6.7],["on",6.7,7.0],["ice",7.0,7.4],["called",7.4,8.14],["Curling.",8.14,8.74]]},{"start":9.5,"end":14.78,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 16 on page 4.","words":[["First",9.5,10.22],["you",10.22,10.44],["have",10.44,10.58],["some",10.58,10.76],["time",10.76,11.08],["to",11.08,11.32],["look",11.32,11.44],["at",11.44,11.58],["questions",11.58,11.92],["11",11.92,12.54],["to",12.54,12.76],["16",12.76,13.24],["on",13.24,14.02],["page",14.02,14.3],["4.",14.3,14.78]]},{"start":35.09,"end":38.57,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 16.","words":[["Now",35.09,35.43],["listen",35.43,35.75],["carefully",35.75,36.21],["and",36.21,36.53],["answer",36.53,36.91],["questions",36.91,37.31],["11",37.31,37.93],["to",37.93,38.11],["16.",38.11,38.57]]},{"start":41.94,"end":46.58,"text":"It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to the Montreal Curling Club.","words":[["It",41.94,42.58],["gives",42.58,42.88],["me",42.88,43.12],["great",43.12,43.56],["pleasure",43.56,44.08],["to",44.08,44.4],["welcome",44.4,44.68],["you",44.68,44.96],["to",44.96,45.16],["the",45.16,45.28],["Montreal",45.28,45.68],["Curling",45.68,46.2],["Club.",46.2,46.58]]},{"start":46.98,"end":51.14,"text":"I hope you'll enjoy the introductory program we've prepared for you.","words":[["I",46.98,47.48],["hope",47.48,47.66],["you'll",47.66,47.94],["enjoy",47.94,48.4],["the",48.4,48.66],["introductory",48.66,49.16],["program",49.16,49.92],["we've",49.92,50.38],["prepared",50.38,50.6],["for",50.6,50.92],["you.",50.92,51.14]]},{"start":52.24,"end":58.38,"text":"I'll start with a brief introduction to the game itself and the equipment, so that you'll","words":[["I'll",52.24,52.52],["start",52.52,52.98],["with",52.98,53.36],["a",53.36,53.58],["brief",53.58,53.86],["introduction",53.86,54.5],["to",54.5,55.02],["the",55.02,55.14],["game",55.14,55.36],["itself",55.36,55.84],["and",55.84,56.3],["the",56.3,56.54],["equipment,",56.54,56.94],["so",57.66,58.08],["that",58.08,58.26],["you'll",58.26,58.38]]},{"start":58.38,"end":60.96,"text":"be able to enjoy it when you watch it later on.","words":[["be",58.38,58.5],["able",58.5,58.66],["to",58.66,58.8],["enjoy",58.8,59.24],["it",59.24,59.48],["when",59.48,59.68],["you",59.68,59.82],["watch",59.82,60.18],["it",60.18,60.34],["later",60.34,60.56],["on.",60.56,60.96]]},{"start":61.8,"end":65.64,"text":"I'll then go on to say a little about the history of the sport and the club.","words":[["I'll",61.8,62.02],["then",62.02,62.18],["go",62.18,62.38],["on",62.38,62.48],["to",62.48,62.6],["say",62.6,62.76],["a",62.76,62.9],["little",62.9,63.04],["about",63.04,63.3],["the",63.3,63.48],["history",63.48,63.84],["of",63.84,64.14],["the",64.14,64.24],["sport",64.24,64.64],["and",64.64,65.2],["the",65.2,65.4],["club.",65.4,65.64]]},{"start":67.08,"end":72.68,"text":"So first let's take a look at the game of curling and the implements it uses.","words":[["So",67.08,67.62],["first",67.62,68.16],["let's",68.16,68.66],["take",68.66,68.88],["a",68.88,69.04],["look",69.04,69.16],["at",69.16,69.32],["the",69.32,69.42],["game",69.42,69.7],["of",69.7,69.86],["curling",69.86,70.26],["and",70.26,71.22],["the",71.22,71.5],["implements",71.5,72.1],["it",72.1,72.36],["uses.",72.36,72.68]]},{"start":73.74,"end":79.58,"text":"It's played on ice and the object of the game is for two teams to push heavy stones","words":[["It's",73.74,74.06],["played",74.06,74.3],["on",74.3,74.58],["ice",74.58,75.0],["and",75.0,75.82],["the",75.82,75.96],["object",75.96,76.28],["of",76.28,76.48],["the",76.48,76.56],["game",76.56,76.84],["is",76.84,77.04],["for",77.04,77.18],["two",77.18,77.44],["teams",77.44,77.94],["to",77.94,78.48],["push",78.48,78.76],["heavy",78.76,79.04],["stones",79.04,79.58]]},{"start":79.58,"end":87.02,"text":"across the ice towards a target. Now, there are four people in each of the two","words":[["across",79.58,80.04],["the",80.04,80.38],["ice",80.38,80.68],["towards",80.68,81.22],["a",81.22,81.68],["target.",81.68,82.0],["Now,",83.06,83.64],["there",84.0,84.66],["are",84.66,84.86],["four",84.86,85.2],["people",85.2,85.62],["in",85.62,86.14],["each",86.14,86.5],["of",86.5,86.66],["the",86.66,86.8],["two",86.8,87.02]]},{"start":87.02,"end":94.8,"text":"teams. The first is called the lead. The next is called the second. The next, surprise","words":[["teams.",87.02,87.56],["The",88.06,88.32],["first",88.32,88.66],["is",88.66,88.96],["called",88.96,89.36],["the",89.36,89.86],["lead.",89.86,90.28],["The",90.92,91.18],["next",91.18,91.52],["is",91.52,91.78],["called",91.78,92.04],["the",92.04,92.26],["second.",92.26,92.66],["The",93.44,93.7],["next,",93.7,94.1],["surprise",94.28,94.8]]},{"start":94.8,"end":100.62,"text":"surprise, is called the third. And the final player, who is absolutely key,","words":[["surprise,",94.8,95.22],["is",95.88,96.14],["called",96.14,96.52],["the",96.52,96.78],["third.",96.78,97.12],["And",97.46,97.88],["the",97.88,98.02],["final",98.02,98.28],["player,",98.28,98.7],["who",98.94,99.2],["is",99.2,99.36],["absolutely",99.36,99.96],["key,",99.96,100.62]]},{"start":100.62,"end":111.38,"text":"functions as the captain, but is always called the skip. That's S-K-I-P. The area","words":[["functions",100.62,101.6],["as",101.6,102.18],["the",102.18,102.36],["captain,",102.36,102.76],["but",103.16,103.38],["is",103.38,103.58],["always",103.58,103.98],["called",103.98,104.5],["the",104.5,105.38],["skip.",105.38,105.82],["That's",107.06,107.82],["S",107.82,108.04],["-K",108.04,108.42],["-I",108.42,109.06],["-P.",109.06,109.64],["The",110.58,111.04],["area",111.04,111.38]]},{"start":111.38,"end":117.52,"text":"of play on the ice, whether it be on a rink or on a frozen lake or a stream, is","words":[["of",111.38,111.68],["play",111.68,112.02],["on",112.02,112.24],["the",112.24,112.4],["ice,",112.4,112.76],["whether",113.2,113.48],["it",113.48,113.66],["be",113.66,113.76],["on",113.76,113.92],["a",113.92,114.04],["rink",114.04,114.4],["or",114.4,114.8],["on",114.8,114.94],["a",114.94,115.08],["frozen",115.08,115.32],["lake",115.32,115.74],["or",115.74,116.14],["a",116.14,116.34],["stream,",116.34,116.56],["is",117.22,117.52]]},{"start":117.52,"end":129.8,"text":"called the sheet. This long thin area is 42.15 meters by only 4.25 meters, and","words":[["called",117.52,117.94],["the",117.94,118.64],["sheet.",118.64,118.98],["This",119.98,120.54],["long",120.54,120.9],["thin",120.9,121.22],["area",121.22,121.6],["is",121.6,122.24],["42",122.24,122.76],[".15",122.76,124.18],["meters",124.18,124.78],["by",124.78,125.24],["only",125.24,125.62],["4",125.62,126.8],[".25",126.8,128.14],["meters,",128.14,128.82],["and",129.18,129.8]]},{"start":129.8,"end":135.6,"text":"And unlike ice hockey ice, for example, it is constantly groomed by frequent shaving","words":[["And",129.8,129.86],["unlike",129.86,130.54],["ice",130.54,130.98],["hockey",130.98,131.28],["ice,",131.28,131.64],["for",131.74,131.8],["example,",131.8,132.18],["it",132.76,132.94],["is",132.94,133.12],["constantly",133.12,133.76],["groomed",133.76,134.52],["by",134.52,134.68],["frequent",134.68,135.12],["shaving",135.12,135.6]]},{"start":135.6,"end":137.54,"text":"to keep it perfectly level.","words":[["to",135.6,136.14],["keep",136.14,136.34],["it",136.34,136.5],["perfectly",136.5,137.1],["level.",137.1,137.54]]},{"start":138.64,"end":142.5,"text":"At either end of this are the two zones for the targets.","words":[["At",138.64,139.08],["either",139.08,139.4],["end",139.4,139.7],["of",139.7,139.9],["this",139.9,140.16],["are",140.16,140.62],["the",140.62,140.78],["two",140.78,141.08],["zones",141.08,141.68],["for",141.68,141.98],["the",141.98,142.08],["targets.",142.08,142.5]]},{"start":143.24,"end":145.66,"text":"Each one is known as a house.","words":[["Each",143.24,143.54],["one",143.54,143.86],["is",143.86,144.18],["known",144.18,144.4],["as",144.4,144.74],["a",144.74,144.9],["house.",144.9,145.66]]},{"start":146.54,"end":148.9,"text":"A little bit about the equipment we need.","words":[["A",146.54,146.86],["little",146.86,147.1],["bit",147.1,147.32],["about",147.32,147.6],["the",147.6,147.82],["equipment",147.82,148.26],["we",148.26,148.64],["need.",148.64,148.9]]},{"start":149.52,"end":151.42,"text":"The stones are made from granite.","words":[["The",149.52,149.76],["stones",149.76,150.18],["are",150.18,150.46],["made",150.46,150.66],["from",150.66,150.88],["granite.",150.88,151.42]]},{"start":152.02,"end":156.74,"text":"Originally, these were held by your fingers in holes specially carved out in the top.","words":[["Originally,",152.02,152.5],["these",152.76,152.88],["were",152.88,153.12],["held",153.12,153.36],["by",153.36,153.58],["your",153.58,153.72],["fingers",153.72,154.14],["in",154.14,154.44],["holes",154.44,154.92],["specially",154.92,155.54],["carved",155.54,155.94],["out",155.94,156.18],["in",156.18,156.34],["the",156.34,156.42],["top.",156.42,156.74]]},{"start":156.74,"end":163.02,"text":"but then it was decided to add a handle to get a better grip. The other distinctive","words":[["but",156.74,157.6],["then",157.6,157.82],["it",157.82,157.94],["was",157.94,158.06],["decided",158.06,158.46],["to",158.46,158.8],["add",158.8,159.04],["a",159.04,159.16],["handle",159.16,159.6],["to",159.6,159.9],["get",159.9,160.04],["a",160.04,160.16],["better",160.16,160.36],["grip.",160.36,160.68],["The",161.6,162.16],["other",162.16,162.38],["distinctive",162.38,163.02]]},{"start":163.02,"end":170.6,"text":"implement is the brush or broom. This is used for two purposes, to clean the ice of","words":[["implement",163.02,163.4],["is",163.4,164.14],["the",164.14,164.34],["brush",164.34,164.7],["or",164.7,165.34],["broom.",165.34,165.82],["This",166.8,167.2],["is",167.2,167.36],["used",167.36,167.68],["for",167.68,168.0],["two",168.0,168.28],["purposes,",168.28,168.74],["to",169.34,169.58],["clean",169.58,169.92],["the",169.92,170.12],["ice",170.12,170.42],["of",170.42,170.6]]},{"start":170.6,"end":178.08,"text":"course, but more crucially to warm it. This melts the ice slightly and lessens","words":[["course,",170.6,170.86],["but",171.46,171.8],["more",171.8,172.18],["crucially",172.18,172.72],["to",172.72,173.4],["warm",173.4,173.88],["it.",173.88,174.08],["This",175.04,175.36],["melts",175.36,175.86],["the",175.86,176.28],["ice",176.28,176.62],["slightly",176.62,177.08],["and",177.08,177.52],["lessens",177.52,178.08]]},{"start":178.08,"end":185.38,"text":"the friction so you get a smoother slide. Curling is not an expensive sport. You","words":[["the",178.08,178.28],["friction",178.28,178.62],["so",178.62,179.06],["you",179.06,179.2],["get",179.2,179.36],["a",179.36,179.5],["smoother",179.5,180.3],["slide.",180.3,180.98],["Curling",181.92,182.62],["is",182.62,183.14],["not",183.14,183.42],["an",183.42,183.62],["expensive",183.62,184.18],["sport.",184.18,184.66],["You",185.14,185.38]]},{"start":185.38,"end":191.72,"text":"don't buy your own stones. In fact, it is illegal to play in a match with your own stones, but","words":[["don't",185.38,185.6],["buy",185.6,185.9],["your",185.9,186.14],["own",186.14,186.34],["stones.",186.34,186.7],["In",187.2,187.38],["fact,",187.38,187.72],["it",188.16,188.3],["is",188.3,188.48],["illegal",188.48,188.96],["to",188.96,189.32],["play",189.32,189.6],["in",189.6,189.74],["a",189.74,189.82],["match",189.82,190.14],["with",190.14,190.34],["your",190.34,190.5],["own",190.5,190.68],["stones,",190.68,191.12],["but",191.36,191.72]]},{"start":191.72,"end":200.32,"text":"you can use your own brush. There are two main types, Scottish and Canadian. The former","words":[["you",191.72,192.14],["can",192.14,192.52],["use",192.52,192.92],["your",192.92,193.26],["own",193.26,193.66],["brush.",193.66,194.08],["There",194.98,195.44],["are",195.44,195.6],["two",195.6,195.88],["main",195.88,196.24],["types,",196.24,196.66],["Scottish",197.22,197.68],["and",197.68,198.46],["Canadian.",198.46,198.92],["The",199.66,200.0],["former",200.0,200.32]]},{"start":200.32,"end":205.4,"text":"are normally made out of horsehair, and the latter, which are now more frequently","words":[["are",200.32,200.82],["normally",200.82,201.3],["made",201.3,201.66],["out",201.66,201.9],["of",201.9,202.06],["horsehair,",202.06,202.74],["and",202.94,203.28],["the",203.28,203.4],["latter,",203.4,203.66],["which",204.0,204.4],["are",204.4,204.56],["now",204.56,204.74],["more",204.74,205.0],["frequently",205.0,205.4]]},{"start":205.4,"end":210.36,"text":"used, are made of synthetic materials, and they don't leave as many threads on","words":[["used,",205.4,205.84],["are",206.32,206.46],["made",206.46,206.7],["of",206.7,206.82],["synthetic",206.82,207.3],["materials,",207.3,207.9],["and",208.3,208.66],["they",208.66,208.86],["don't",208.86,209.16],["leave",209.16,209.36],["as",209.36,209.52],["many",209.52,209.74],["threads",209.74,210.12],["on",210.12,210.36]]},{"start":210.36,"end":216.06,"text":"the ice. Now, apart from stones and brushes, the only other piece of equipment you would","words":[["the",210.36,210.5],["ice.",210.5,210.68],["Now,",211.4,211.88],["apart",212.24,212.68],["from",212.68,212.94],["stones",212.94,213.28],["and",213.28,213.7],["brushes,",213.7,214.08],["the",214.42,214.5],["only",214.5,214.72],["other",214.72,214.94],["piece",214.94,215.2],["of",215.2,215.36],["equipment",215.36,215.7],["you",215.7,215.94],["would",215.94,216.06]]},{"start":216.06,"end":222.0,"text":"need as a beginner is a rubber's sole on one of your shoes, depending on which shoe you","words":[["need",216.06,216.32],["as",216.32,216.54],["a",216.54,216.62],["beginner",216.62,216.94],["is",216.94,217.54],["a",217.54,217.68],["rubber's",217.68,218.24],["sole",218.24,218.6],["on",218.6,218.88],["one",218.88,219.08],["of",219.08,219.2],["your",219.2,219.36],["shoes,",219.36,219.8],["depending",220.26,220.62],["on",220.62,220.98],["which",220.98,221.26],["shoe",221.26,221.72],["you",221.72,222.0]]},{"start":222.0,"end":228.72,"text":"lead from. The captain will often carry a stopwatch to gauge when the ice needs to","words":[["lead",222.0,222.86],["from.",222.86,223.4],["The",224.22,224.36],["captain",224.36,224.7],["will",224.7,224.98],["often",224.98,225.26],["carry",225.26,225.62],["a",225.62,225.82],["stopwatch",225.82,226.44],["to",226.44,227.02],["gauge",227.02,227.38],["when",227.38,227.7],["the",227.7,227.86],["ice",227.86,228.12],["needs",228.12,228.52],["to",228.52,228.72]]},{"start":228.72,"end":233.9,"text":"be changed. All equipment and clothing can be bought in the club shop.","words":[["be",228.72,228.84],["changed.",228.84,229.34],["All",230.38,230.74],["equipment",230.74,231.16],["and",231.16,231.46],["clothing",231.46,231.82],["can",231.82,232.56],["be",232.56,232.76],["bought",232.76,233.04],["in",233.04,233.2],["the",233.2,233.3],["club",233.3,233.52],["shop.",233.52,233.9]]},{"start":233.9,"end":244.0,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 17-20 on page 4.","words":[["Before",233.9,234.98],["you",237.8,238.12],["hear",238.12,238.32],["the",238.32,238.5],["rest",238.5,238.7],["of",238.7,238.8],["the",238.8,238.9],["talk,",238.9,239.2],["you",239.6,239.76],["have",239.76,239.92],["some",239.92,240.08],["time",240.08,240.44],["to",240.44,240.64],["look",240.64,240.76],["at",240.76,240.88],["questions",240.88,241.12],["17",241.12,241.98],["-20",241.98,242.52],["on",242.52,243.22],["page",243.22,243.52]